# Run r1102b, slice 2, boot B: group B fresh normal world (prep_srv.sh OUT_B s2b B: seed 8675309, structures on).
# Probes: zz_zq_probe.js (prep_srv.sh), zz_count.js (tools/fungi_probe/zcount.js). No player: "fly around" and "look at
# the farms" become /locate + forceload 7 x 7 chunks around the hit + /zq count of the blocks in a box (y 40..160).
# Locates may be async (Async Locator): every capture waits for its "is at [" line first.
# Order: boot greps, biome rows (jungle, savanna, beach), villages (five types), deadwood metas, then the End (INV-06).
pace 2

## SQ-WCD-01 | wild crops at boot: modifier counts, tag check, unclassified warning
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[wild-crops\] \d+ crop modifiers added, \d+ mod modifiers off, \d+ biome-file patches removed
bootexpect \[wild-crops\] \d+ crop/biome pairs in \d+ crop tags
bootreject Error occurred while handling event.*wild_crops
shell grep -E "\[wild-crops\]" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-400
look the counts (62 / 49 / 12 on 2026-10-25; each missing mod named in a "mod not loaded, skipped" line); no "problems" error lines; the Terralith cave biomes warning names biome_traits.json

## SQ-WCD-03 | no wild-crops tag problems
bootreject \[wild-crops\] .*(no such biome|is not in #creativedelight:wild_crops/|could not read)

## SQ-RD-10 | village farm crops: log line; savanna farms grow cotton, plains unchanged
# stale queue text: the line now reads "added to N pool elements of M listed farm templates" (VillageFarmCrops.java)
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] village farm crops added to [1-9]\d* pool elements of \d+ listed farm templates$
bootreject village farm crops .*failed
> locate structure minecraft:village_savanna
waitlog is at \[ 600
capture VS is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {VS1-48} {VS3-48} {VS1+48} {VS3+48}
sleep 40
> zq count {VS1-56} 40 {VS3-56} {VS1+56} 160 {VS3+56} rusticdelight:cotton
waitlog \[zq\] count rusticdelight:cotton 300
> zq count {VS1-56} 40 {VS3-56} {VS1+56} 160 {VS3+56} minecraft:wheat
waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:wheat 300
expect \[zq\] count rusticdelight:cotton: [1-9]\d*
> locate structure minecraft:village_plains
waitlog The nearest minecraft:village_plains 600
capture VP The nearest minecraft:village_plains is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {VP1-48} {VP3-48} {VP1+48} {VP3+48}
sleep 40
> zq count {VP1-56} 40 {VP3-56} {VP1+56} 160 {VP3+56} rusticdelight:cotton
sleep 45
> zq count {VP1-56} 40 {VP3-56} {VP1+56} 160 {VP3+56} minecraft:wheat
sleep 45
look savanna box: cotton among the vanilla crops (about 25%); plains box: cotton 0 (the second cotton count line); a count of 0 crops at all = the box missed the village (judge against the wheat count)

## SQ-WCD-07 | savanna village farms read the renamed cotton tag
> zq count {VS1-56} 40 {VS3-56} {VS1+56} 160 {VS3+56} rusticdelight:cotton
