waitlog \[zq\] count rusticdelight:bell_pepper_red_block 300
expect \[zq\] count rusticdelight:bell_pepper_red_block: 0
> locate biome minecraft:savanna
waitlog The nearest minecraft:savanna 600
capture SV The nearest minecraft:savanna is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {SV1-64} {SV3-64} {SV1+64} {SV3+64}
sleep 60
> zq count {SV1-72} 40 {SV3-72} {SV1+72} 160 {SV3+72} rusticdelight:wild_cotton
waitlog \[zq\] count rusticdelight:wild_cotton 300
