sleep 45
> zq count {SV1-72} 40 {SV3-72} {SV1+72} 160 {SV3+72} rusticdelight:wild_coffee
sleep 30
> zq biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/bell_pepper
> zq biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/coffee
> zq biometag creativedelight:wild_crops/giant_bell_pepper
look jungle box: wild bell peppers and wild coffee present, no giant pepper; savanna box (9 x 9 chunks): wild cotton present, giant peppers rare (about 1 patch per 64 chunks: 0 or 1 patch here is normal); the biometag lines show warm wet (peppers, coffee) and warm dry grassy (giant pepper) lists only

## SQ-DW-01 | deadwood metas staged, report lists group/deadwood
bootreject (?i)deadwood.*(does not exist|staging error|unknown)
bootexpect \[meta-structures\]
shell grep -n -A12 "group/deadwood" kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/structure_tag_report.md | head -16
shell grep -q "6 of 6 members live" kubejs/generation_scripts/worldgen/structure_tag_report.md
shell grep -iE "deadwood|\[meta-structures\]" logs/latest.log | head -10
look report: Grid spacing 16, separation 5, 6 members (acacia, birch, cherry, jungle, oak, spruce)

## SQ-DW-02 | acacia deadwood near a savanna: own wood only
> execute positioned {SV1} 80 {SV3} run locate structure creativeengineering:meta/deadwood_acacia
waitlog The nearest creativeengineering:meta/deadwood_acacia|Could not find 900
capture DA The nearest creativeengineering:meta/deadwood_acacia is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {DA1-16} {DA3-16} {DA1+16} {DA3+16}
sleep 30
> zq count {DA1-24} 40 {DA3-24} {DA1+24} 160 {DA3+24} minecraft:acacia_log
waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:acacia_log 300
> zq count {DA1-24} 40 {DA3-24} {DA1+24} 160 {DA3+24} minecraft:oak_log
sleep 20
expect \[zq\] count minecraft:acacia_log: ([5-9]|\d\d+)
look found within about 30 chunks of the savanna hit (blocks away in the locate line); oak count near 0 (savanna trees are acacia; an oak count from nearby trees is not a fail on its own)

